<translate>
==== HitSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. Indicates the sound that will be played when the item hits. You can set the value to 'null' (to remove the sound).
<syntaxhighlight lang='Java'>
HitSound = BaseballBatHit,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

